# E7-1 keyed-run campaign secrets — NEVER commit the filled creds.
#
# The operator fills `.env.campaign` with a live E2B key, DB passwords, and bearer
# secrets, and writes the ed25519 keypair + enrollment ticket under `secrets/`. A
# `git add docker/campaign` would otherwise stage all of it. The `.example` template
# stays tracked (it is the shape-only reference; it holds no real secret).
.env.campaign
secrets/

# Keep the template tracked even though `.env.campaign*` would otherwise be caught
# by a broader pattern — this negation is defensive and harmless today.
!.env.campaign.example
